  "review_notes": [
    "לֹא לָכֶם לְהִלָּחֵם is recast as Ye shall not need to fight: the preposition carries the modal frame and its suffix the subject pronoun, on the pattern rule 43 sets for a possessive preposition. The competing reading leaves shall ... need to the infinitive under rule 52.",
